<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92498" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥῑνός</span></b>  (v. sub fin.), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>skin</i> of a living person, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.308
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				5.426
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				435
			</span></i>, etc.; rarely of a corpse, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				14.134
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				152
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>hide</i> of a beast, esp. <i>ox-hide</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				1.108
			</span></i>, al.; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ. πολιοῖο λύκοιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					10.334
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ. λέοντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>I.</u>
					5(6).37
				</span></i>
			; not in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> of the skin of a live beast, but so used by <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				515
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sc.</u>
				427
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πωλικῆς ῥινοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					784
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>oxhide shield</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύν ῥ᾽ ἔβαλον ῥινούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					4.447
				</span></i>
			 (imitated by <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				1274
			</span></i>); cf. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				16.636
			</span></i> and 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥινόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> pl.,
				<i>thongs of boxing-gloves</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.58
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>leather</i> of a sling, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.172
			</span></i> (Antip. Sid.).—The gender is fem. in <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				7.248
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				20.276
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				22.278
			</span></i> (v.l.), <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				152
			</span></i>, E.l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				361
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.174
			</span></i>; masc. in <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				476
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				3.277
			</span></i>: cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥινόν, τό. </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝρῑνός</span>, as shown by <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γρῖνος: δέρμα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γρίντης: βυρσεύς</span>, Id.:
			cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταλαύρινος</span>.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
